{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"七年春王三月，叔姬歸于紀。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"滕侯卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"夏，城中丘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"秋，公伐邾。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"冬，天王使凡伯來聘。戎伐凡伯于楚丘，以歸。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"七年春，滕侯卒。不書名，未同盟也。凡諸侯同盟，於是稱名，故薨則赴以名，告終稱嗣也，以繼好息民，謂之禮經。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"夏，城中丘，書，不時也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"齊侯使夷仲年來聘，結艾之盟也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"秋，宋及鄭平。七月庚申，盟于宿。公伐邾，為宋討也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"初，戎朝于周，發幣于公卿，凡伯弗賓。冬，王使凡伯來聘。還，戎伐之于楚丘以歸。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"陳及鄭平。十二月，陳五父如鄭涖盟。壬申，及鄭伯盟，歃如忘。洩伯曰：「五父必不免，不賴盟矣。」鄭良佐如陳涖盟，辛巳，及陳侯盟，亦知陳之將亂也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_7_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_7","textTraditional":"鄭公子忽在王所，故陳侯請妻之。鄭伯許之，乃成昬。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}